figdown 0.1 block
# Retired spellings report their migration by name (the `colw` -> `width`
# precedent), so an authoring agent fixes each in one step.
#
# 0.1 (`EDGE-GEOMETRY-CONSTRUCTS`) put a SECOND shape in this fixture. `path` and `routing`
# were WITHDRAWN, not renamed: their messages name no replacement spelling,
# because there is none. `route` — renamed `path` — now states
# the whole chain and ends in the withdrawal, so the two-hop lookup is still
# one lookup even when the second hop is a deletion.
node a "A"
line "cap" in=a at=50%
fill 15% in=a
route a -> a via=(10,10)
path a -> a points=(10,10)
routing orthogonal
colw auto
render
